  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "At Maple Leaf City, he stands in the middle of three rank eight Gu Immortals on the clouds and sighs that the child has finally been born. He is an old man with a benevolent countenance whose brows are like two exquisite dark brown roots extending from his forehead to his chest. He explains destined luck of humanity among Immortal Venerables and Demon Venerables, then coughs blood after heavy injuries taken to block calamities and tribulations. Citing fate Gu’s revelation, he tells Duke Long that the child will become a venerable and that Duke Long is the Dao Guardian, then sends him to take the disciple.",
      "chapters": [
        1675
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "gu_fate_gu",
        "char_duke_long",
        "sys_dao_guardian"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Duke Tong says that when they return to Heavenly Court, Duke Mei and he will enter a very long hibernation to recuperate, and that the era of the Three Dukes of Heavenly Court is over as Duke Long leads onward.",
      "chapters": [
        1675
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "three-dukes-era",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_duke_tong",
        "fac_heavenly_court"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "In a recollection, he and Duke Tong praise Duke Long’s rank eight cultivation and ask him to become one of them, lead Heavenly Court, and guide the future Immortal Venerable seed; from that day he is Duke Long, one of the three dukes.",
      "chapters": [
        1949
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "naming-duke-long",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "From the immortal graveyard light, he walks out with Duke Tong after Fairy Ming Hao’s call. He squints and says he heard the call.",
      "chapters": [
        2180
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "awakening-at-book-mountain",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fairy_ming_hao"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He remembers meeting young Duke Long on joining Heavenly Court, greets him as a Dao Guardian despite seniority, and after reawakening finds Duke Long already dead, then flies forward saying it is their turn.",
      "chapters": [
        2181
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "awakening-at-book-mountain",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Against Dragon Soul Dark Castle and Red Heavenly Altar he aims both arms; dry, tough vines bind the Immortal Gu Houses and absorb their immortal essence storages. He and Duke Tong have rank eight cultivation and battle strength on par with Qin Ding Ling, without Duke Long’s pseudo venerable battle strength.",
      "chapters": [
        2181
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "vine-restraint",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "house_dragon_soul_dark_castle",
        "house_red_heavenly_altar",
        "sys_immortal_gu_house",
        "char_qin_ding_ling"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Zhan Bu Du breaks his killer move and punches his head apart; his phantom aperture flies toward the immortal graveyard. He later joins others blocking Fang Yuan again.",
      "chapters": [
        2191
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "deaths-and-delays",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_zhan_bu_du",
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "At the Crazed Demon formation he is among those who walk forward to delay the assault.",
      "chapters": [
        2198
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "deaths-and-delays",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_crazed_demon_formation"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He stands center among three rank eight Gu Immortals with Seven Fiendish Primeval Monarch and Golden Hooped Great Immortal, sent on Star Constellation Immortal Venerable’s orders to capture Fairy Zi Wei.",
      "chapters": [
        2270
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "capture-order",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_seven_fiendish_primeval_monarch",
        "char_golden_hooped_great_immortal",
        "char_star_constellation_immortal_venerable",
        "char_fairy_zi_wei"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "His long eyebrows shake when he senses Spectral Soul Demon Venerable. He is first to use a killer move, then helps defend the Shadow Sect immortals against Spectral Soul rather than striking them first.",
      "chapters": [
        2270
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "capture-order",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_spectral_soul_demon_venerable",
        "fac_shadow_sect"
      ]
    }
  ],
